# Build artifacts. Anchored: an unanchored `consensus` or `bench` also matches
# the cmd/consensus and bench source directories, so new files there were
# silently untracked. `make build` writes into bin/; release.yml writes
# consensus-<os>-<arch> here.
build/
dist/
/consensus
/consensus-*

